  "heldout_second_touch_justification": "EXP-42 operational pilot, 112 of 1,144 pairs (9.8%). Authorised by Benjy on 2026-07-29 in session; NO supervisor sign-off is recorded for this pilot and none is claimed here. Purpose is to confirm the corroborative arm runs correctly end to end before any full-battery dispatch, not to answer the research question: 112 pairs is under-powered for the registered endpoints and will not be reported as a result. Characterisation only, no adoption rule, cannot tune production (D45). This is a second touch of the D47 frozen set and burns it for later tuning; disclosed here, in docs/SPEC.md and in the dissertation limitations.",
