  "budget_calls": 6000,
  "_note": "Deterministic 10% sample, evenly spaced through each ODMI dimension's sorted question list: I 4/38, P 3/31, PT 4/45, Q 3/29 = 14 questions x 8 countries. Seed coverage 41/112 = 36.6%, against the full battery's 392/1,144 = 34.3%, so the sample is representative on the seeded/unseeded axis. Separate experiment_id from exp42_stance_heldout so pilot rows never mix with the registered run. `strategy` is deliberately NOT pinned: the coordinator derives verifier-corroborate from pipeline_mode=cooperative and --strategy rejects it.",
